 "name_en": "Accounts Payable (J60)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Accounts Payable (J60)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6c7e7a3deb594670a1eda8829188c563\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6c7e7a3deb594670a1eda8829188c563__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">With Accounts Payable, you manage your open payable invoices that are automatically created from purchasing processes.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">You manage and control open items with various analytical tools. You plan future payables and analyze the outcome of payments, such as utilization of cash discounts and days payables outstanding.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Process your outstanding payables automatically and monitor payment progress. Optionally, you can also include a two-step approval for all outgoing payments.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Connect to SAP Multi-Bank Connectivity (MBC) to simplify the connectivity to the banks for payments and bank statements. Alternatively, you can also download generated payment files.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">For countries/regions where this is relevant, you can also print checks.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6c7e7a3deb594670a1eda8829188c563__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage and complete supplier master data</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create invoice from logistics</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze outstanding payables</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Pay invoice</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Approve payments (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Forward payments to banks via SAP Multi-Bank Connectivity (MBC) or download payment file</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze efficiency of payment processing</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6c7e7a3deb594670a1eda8829188c563__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate accounts payable into procurement</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Record accounts payable posting directly in the general ledger</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Payment program can automatically create instructions for bank transfers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Payment approval can be used for workflow</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use simple and secure connectivity for transacting with multiple financial institutes or download the payment instruction file for further manual processing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze the efficiency of your payment processing</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>应付账款 (J60)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6c7e7a3deb594670a1eda8829188c563\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6c7e7a3deb594670a1eda8829188c563__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过应付账款，您可以管理通过采购流程自动创建的未清应付账款发票。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">您可以使用各种分析工具管理和控制未清项目。您可以计划未来应付账款并分析付款结果，例如现金折扣利用率和应付账款周转天数。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">自动处理未清应付账款并监控付款进度。或者，您还可以对所有付款进行两步审批。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">连接到 SAP Multi-Bank Connectivity (MBC) 以简化付款和银行对账单与银行的连接。或者，您还可以下载生成的付款文件。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">对于相关的国家/地区，您还可以打印支票。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6c7e7a3deb594670a1eda8829188c563__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">管理和完成供应商主数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">从物流创建发票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分析未清应付账款</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">支付发票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批付款（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过 SAP Multi-Bank Connectivity (MBC) 向银行转发付款或下载付款文件</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">分析付款处理效率</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6c7e7a3deb594670a1eda8829188c563__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将应付账款集成到采购中</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">直接在总账中记录应付账款过账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">付款程序可以自动创建银行转账指令</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">付款审批可用于工作流</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用简单安全的连接与多个财务机构进行交易，或下载付款指令文件以进一步手动处理</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分析付款处理的效率</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
